abstract: "kwik-e-gate is a local deterministic gate that selects repository-owned checks and issues receipts bound to what ran. Its Python core has zero runtime dependencies. The optional quick-gate npm adapter preserves JS/TS diagnostics, its standalone API and explicit bounded repair. Model review is optional."
